Package: copynumber
Title: Segmentation of single- and multi-track copy number data by
    penalized least squares regression (with hg38 and mm10).
Version: 1.29.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gro", "Nilsen", , "gronilse@ifi.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Knut", "Liestol", role = "aut"),
    person("Ole Christian", "Lingjaerde", role = "aut"),
    person("Igor", "Dolgalev", , "igor.dolgalev@nyumc.org", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4451-126X"))
  )
Description: Penalized least squares regression is applied to fit
    piecewise constant curves to copy number data to locate genomic
    regions of constant copy number. Procedures are available for
    individual segmentation of each sample, joint segmentation of several
    samples and joint segmentation of the two data tracks from SNP-arrays.
    Several plotting functions are available for visualization of the data
    and the segmentation results.
